Bind Npc 24413 Zone 1
Quest 200 "Protecting the farm"
    Journal "Farm Manager wants me to eliminate the Tyon and bring him Tyon meat."
    Collect 1 of 379204000

Requires player level >= 47 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 10000 coins

On available
    Say "Tyons penetrated the farm and are ruining the crops. There's even a reward being offered for Tyons."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "This year's harvest will be ruined because of the Tyons. Wish someone would get rid of them for me."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I will award you handsomely if you eliminate the Tyons what infiltrated the farm and bring me their meat. I'm counting on you."

On in_progress
    Say "Tyons are stock monsters around the farm. There will be plenty of them here."

On ready
    Say "Shouldn't this be enough!? If we hand over the meat to the Farm Manager, we will get a large reward."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Not bad. Look outside. There's already some of them lurking outside. but they will multiply again as they have superior breeding ability."

On completed
    Say "Tyons have disappeared to an extent, but they will multiply again as they have superior breeding ability."
